    {
      "id": "EXP-GEAR-001",
      "title": "装备耗能与补燃料的单位、段位和退出接线",
      "aliases": [
        "fueled",
        "装备耗燃料",
        "TakeFuelItem",
        "fuelvalue",
        "section",
        "ADDFUEL"
      ],
      "engineering_question": "怎样让装备期间扣燃料、卸下停止，并通过单件材料补充，保存时保留哪些实际状态？",
      "knowledge_status": "research",
      "retrieval_status": "restricted",
      "coding_status": "hold",
      "scope": {
        "source_epoch": "762172 / Steam build 26474873",
        "evidence": "指定冻结ZIP的静态 Lua 定义与具名消费者",
        "execution_side": "所选 spear/amulet prefab 在 SetPristine 后的 mastersim 分支配置权威组件；组件方法本身无端别门禁。",
        "runtime_verified": false,
        "increment": "复用 ID-C03/C04 的组件算术与保存；新增同一 yellowamulet 的安装、装备/模型出口、补料和移除接线，连接 ADDFUEL 单件边界。"
      },
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": "EXP-GEAR-001-C01",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "Fueled 默认 rate=1、period=1、sections=1、consuming=false、accepting=false。DoUpdate(dt) 在 consuming 时扣 dt*rate*rate_modifiers:Get()，空时 StopConsuming，最后 updatefn(inst)。因此 rate 的单位为每个 dt 时间单位消耗的 fuel 单位，rate=1 且倍率1时 fuel 数值才与秒数对应。LongUpdate 是 DoUpdate 的别名，其调用时机及 dt 来源另由调用者决定。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "GEAR-S13",
            "GEAR-S18",
            "GEAR-S11"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-GEAR-001-C02",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "InitializeFuelLevel 可向上提升 maxfuel，再直接写 currentfuel，段位变化时调用 sectionfn(new,old,inst) 并通知 onfueldsectionchanged，不启动消费或调用 depleted。DoDelta(amount,doer) 则钳制到[0,maxfuel]；段位变化时依次 sectionfn(new,old,inst,doer)、段位事件、当时 currentfuel<=0 则 depleted(inst)，最后总发 percentusedchange。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "GEAR-S17"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-GEAR-001-C03",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "GetPercent 钳制到[0,1]，空燃料的段位为0，非空为 min(floor(percent*sections)+1,sections)。段内比例为 percent*sections-section+1，空燃料时结果为1。ChangeSection(amount) 实际交给 DoDelta 的量为 amount*maxfuel/sections-1；精确燃料成本可用 DoDelta 的燃料单位配置。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "GEAR-S15",
            "GEAR-S16"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-GEAR-001-C04",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "StartConsuming 置 consuming，task 为空才安装以 period 为 dt 的周期任务。SetFirstPeriod 配置额外一次 wall-update 消费，满量时选 firstperiodfull 真值，否则 firstperiod；OnWallUpdate 在服务器暂停时返回，正常时使用保存的 firstperioddt。StopConsuming 清状态并取消周期任务及未执行的首期 wall 更新；OnRemoveFromEntity 也调用 StopConsuming。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "GEAR-S13",
            "GEAR-S16",
            "GEAR-S18"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-GEAR-001-C05",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "amulet.lua 的 file-local yellow/onequip_yellow/onunequip_yellow/onequiptomodel_yellow 为真实装备消费者。yellow 在 master 分支设置 NIGHTMARE 燃料、接受补料、初始化容量和首期参数；装备开始消费，卸下或装备到模型停止并清灯。灯实体由退出回调清理，保存体只存非满时的 currentfuel；OnLoad 恢复零燃料不会直接重放 depleted 或恢复 consuming。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "GEAR-S19",
            "GEAR-S20",
            "GEAR-S21",
            "GEAR-S14"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-GEAR-001-C06",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "TakeFuelItem 先按 item or doer 检查 accepting 与 fuel/fueler 类型和可选 cantakefuelitemfn(inst,item,doer)。fuelvalue 乘 bonusmult、multfn(inst,fuel_obj)、湿燃料和 fuelmaster 倍率后先 DoDelta；随后 fuel:Taken、ontakefuelitemfn(inst,item,fuelvalue,doer)、item:Remove、ontakefuelfn(inst,fuelvalue)、takefuel 事件，成功返回true。提供 item 时整件 Remove；满量没有内建拒绝，fuelvalue 为计算的投入量，可能大于实际增加量。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "GEAR-S15",
            "GEAR-S25",
            "GEAR-S26"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-GEAR-001-C07",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "普通 fuel 菜单按材料 *_fuel 与目标 *_fueled 标签和骑乘条件选择 ADDFUEL/ADDWETFUEL。ACTIONS.ADDFUEL 先从库存 RemoveItem，堆叠默认分一件，然后 TakeFuelItem；正常拒绝时尝试放回/合并，fueler 路径允许传 nil item 和 doer。该返还没有包裹任意回调异常。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "GEAR-S23",
            "GEAR-S22",
            "GEAR-S24"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-GEAR-001-C08",
          "kind": "REC",
          "statement": "装备与卸下通过现有 Equippable 回调启停同一个 Fueled，复用原版 ADDFUEL 单件提取与正常拒绝返还。需要禁止满量消耗时使用现成 cantakefuelitemfn；补燃料后是否重启消费按当前装备/开关政策处理。构造重建配置与表现，保存沿用燃料值；无需为灯和任务另建持久状态层。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "GEAR-S19",
            "GEAR-S20",
            "GEAR-S22",
            "GEAR-S14",
            "GEAR-S15",
            "GEAR-S27"
          ]
        }
