    {
      "id": "EXP-GEAR-002",
      "title": "按材料维修次数耐久的标签、数值和消费时点",
      "aliases": [
        "repairable",
        "repairer",
        "MATERIALS",
        "finiteusesrepairvalue",
        "onrepaired",
        "维修菜单"
      ],
      "engineering_question": "如何让一种材料修复现有耐久，维修菜单、实际修复量、单件消耗与回调分别在哪里发生？",
      "knowledge_status": "research",
      "retrieval_status": "restricted",
      "coding_status": "hold",
      "scope": {
        "source_epoch": "762172 / Steam build 26474873",
        "evidence": "指定冻结ZIP的静态 Lua 定义与具名消费者",
        "execution_side": "所选 spear/amulet prefab 在 SetPristine 后的 mastersim 分支配置权威组件；组件方法本身无端别门禁。",
        "runtime_verified": false,
        "increment": "复用 BTR-P01/P02 的菜单/执行入口、两种拒绝hook和单件消费；新增 finiteuses 效果分派、数值到资格标签及 orangeamulet/nightmarefuel 具体消费者。"
      },
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": "EXP-GEAR-002-C01",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "Repairer 的 repairmaterial 和正值修复字段通过属性钩子建立 work_/health_/freshen_/finiteuses_ 材料标签。Repairable 按 repairmaterial 和 finiteusesrepairable 等状态建立目标标签。repairable 构造只从已有 workable/health 初始化对应状态，没有读取 finiteuses；finiteuses 属性变化才会更新其 finiteusesrepairable。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "GEAR-S31",
            "GEAR-S28",
            "GEAR-S01"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-GEAR-002-C02",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "USEITEM.repairer 仅在 right 且骑乘/持重条件允许时，遍历 MATERIALS，把材料类型标签与目标类型、可修状态配对后添加 REPAIR。ACTIONS.REPAIR 选择 invobject 或持重 BODY 材料；目标有 repairable 时调用 Repair，不存在时才进入 forgerepairable 分支。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "GEAR-S32",
            "GEAR-S33"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-GEAR-002-C03",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "Repairable:Repair 依序执行 testvalidrepairfn(target,repair_item)、repairer 与 repairmaterial 匹配、checkmaterialfn(target,repair_item)。checkmaterialfn 拒绝可返回 false,reason，其余所列前置拒绝返回false。接着 file-local address_repair_amount 按 health、workable、perishable、finiteuses 顺序选择首个满足修复字段的分支；该分支已满会直接拒绝。全部不匹配时回退 justrunonrepaired。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "GEAR-S30",
            "GEAR-S29"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-GEAR-002-C04",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "finiteusesrepairvalue 为绝对次数，走 finiteuses:Repair 并钳到 total；healthrepairpercent 与 perishrepairpercent 为比例，workrepairvalue 为工作量。NeedsRepairs 使用0.95门槛，具名消费者是 stringutil 的 ANNOUNCE_CANFIX 文案；它不是 Repair 的成功门槛或维修菜单的统一门禁。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "GEAR-S29",
            "GEAR-S04",
            "GEAR-S37",
            "GEAR-S32",
            "GEAR-S30"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-GEAR-002-C05",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "修复量分支成功后，Repair 可先播 boatrepairsound，再对 stackable:Get():Remove 或整件 Remove，随后 onrepaired(target,doer,repair_item)，最后返回true。传给 onrepaired 的仍是原 repair_item；多件堆叠的 Get 分出新实体消费，单件返回原实体，所以回调时原材料可能已经被移除。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "GEAR-S30",
            "GEAR-S36"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-GEAR-002-C06",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "orangeamulet 在 master 分支配置 finiteuses 和 onfinished=inst.Remove 后添加 repairable，设置 MATERIALS.NIGHTMARE 与回调。nightmarefuel 同时配置 NIGHTMARE fuel 和独立的 MATERIALS.NIGHTMARE repairer，其 finiteusesrepairvalue 用 TUNING 配置。两种接收入口分别执行补燃料和维修次数。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "GEAR-S34",
            "GEAR-S35",
            "GEAR-S21"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-GEAR-002-C07",
          "kind": "REC",
          "statement": "自有次数物品按需求选择既有 repairable/repairer 合同，材料设置绝对次数，目标可修标签由 finiteuses 数值驱动。初始已经受损且 repairable 后添加时，显式同步本次修理状态或调整构造顺序即可。反馈用 onrepaired 的 target/doer；需要的材料数据按具体回调生存期获取。按材料维修与套件式 forge 修满沿用现有 items-food-plants 选型。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "GEAR-S01",
            "GEAR-S28",
            "GEAR-S30",
            "GEAR-S34",
            "GEAR-S35"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "api_contracts": [
        {
          "symbol": "Repairable:Repair",
          "source_file": "scripts/components/repairable.lua",
          "visibility": "require 导出的组件类实例方法；方法体没有自行检查执行端。",
          "parameters": [
            "doer 为本次维修操作者，传给最终 onrepaired。",
            "repair_item 为有效材料实体，需要 repairer；回调检查收到原材料引用。"
          ],
          "returns": "拒绝 false，可选 checkmaterialfn 的拒绝原因作为第二返回；成功消费及 onrepaired 正常结束后返回true。",
          "preconditions": [
            "本条用于服务器实际维修动作，目标/材料由正常动作提供。",
            "材料枚举及可修状态满足设计；该方法不复用客户端菜单的骑乘、持重等全部筛选。"
          ],
          "side_effects": [
            "testvalidrepairfn(inst,item) → 类型匹配 → checkmaterialfn(inst,item) → address_repair_amount。",
            "修复顺序为 health/workable/perishable/finiteuses 首个合适字段；已满分支返回false；无分支可由 justrunonrepaired 许可。",
            "成功时先修复数值，再可选声音，消费单件材料，最后 onrepaired(inst,doer,原repair_item)。",
            "finiteuses 的次数更新可同步触发百分比事件；onrepaired 不应假定原材料仍存活。"
          ],
          "lifecycle": "该组件没有自己的 OnSave/OnLoad；耐久保存在被修复组件，材料与回调配置由 prefab 重建。异常发生在回调/分拆等点时不保证回滚。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "GEAR-S28",
            "GEAR-S29",
            "GEAR-S30",
            "GEAR-S36",
            "GEAR-S33"
          ],
